et\n\t\n\nThis is the data behind the paper Sorting, Not Calibration: A Price-Blind Comparison of Language Models and Prediction Markets (arXiv link forthcoming; code and paper PDF at https://github.com/TransformerOptimus/llm-vs-prediction-markets). Eight language models were asked for\nthe probability that a prediction-market question resolves Yes, without being\nshown the market price. Their forecasts are compared with the… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/SuperAGI/llm-vs-prediction-markets.","downloads":289,"tags":["license:cc-by-4.0","license:cc-by-nc-sa-4.0","arxiv:2604.14199","region:us","forecasting","prediction-markets","llm-evaluation"],"createdAt":"2026-09-28T08:47:52.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6aa30142e7162128b6d12755","id":"rhinot/prediction-market-analysis","author":"rhinot","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-12T02:44:58.000Z","likes":0,"private":false,"sha":"969daa41fac3c348255497fa0c1fd3f5b1aa3230","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tPrediction Market Analysis Dataset (Public Mirror)\n\t\n\nThis repository is a durable public mirror of the prediction market dataset collected and originally published by Jonathan Becker (jon-becker/prediction-market-analysis).\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\nThe dataset provides the largest publicly available collection of Polymarket and Kalshi market, order book, and trade history data, covering both API-collected data and blockchain-indexed trade data.\n\nOriginal Creator / Author: Jonathan… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/rhinot/prediction-market-analysis.","downloads":210,"tags":["task_categories:tabular-regression","task_categories:tabular-classification","task_categories:time-series-forecasting","license:mit","size_categories:10B<n<100B","region:us","finance","economics","prediction-markets","polymarket","kalshi"],"createdAt":"2026-09-10T19:13:06.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"68ccc413e322142c75018a31",