istinct text and keyed\nby SHA-256 of its UTF-8 bytes. The main dataset… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/SuperAGI/llm-vs-prediction-markets-news.","downloads":103,"tags":["license:cc-by-4.0","license:cc-by-nc-sa-4.0","size_categories:1K<n<10K","format:parquet","modality:tabular","modality:text","library:datasets","library:dask","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","forecasting","prediction-markets","llm-evaluation","news"],"createdAt":"2026-09-28T08:47:53.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6ad2cbad9e44b1f3f2e9ef48","id":"hyunwookjin/korean-prediction-market-sample","author":"hyunwookjin","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-10-17T09:13:24.000Z","likes":1,"private":false,"sha":"fd3c3f8ef1bb178cbf7b9bd7169c4dcafd7ef9f2","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tMinsim Index — Korean Human Forecasting\n\t\n\nTrack-record-selected forecasters. Strong signals on Korean events.\nMinsim Index turns the judgments of experienced Minsim Market forecasters into a selective signal for Korean politics and the economy. Participants predict what will happen and earn rewards and reputation when their forecasts are correct.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tMinsim Index strong-signal track record\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\nSector\nHit rate\nCorrect / evaluated\n95% Wilson interval\n\n\n\t\t\nPolitics\n94.3%… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/hyunwookjin/korean-prediction-market-sample.","downloads":92,"tags":["task_categories:question-answering","task_categories:text-classification","language:ko","license:cc-by-nc-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","forecasting","prediction-market","collective-intelligence","korea","korean","evaluation","benchmark","politics","economics","sports","time-series"],"createdAt":"2026-10-17T01:13:17.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"69e8ed3ba05422908b01768b","id":"manja3